{"id":211911945599465,"type":"artist","name":"Silver Jews","artist":null,"year":1989,"weight":21,"info":{"tags":["Lo-Fi","Alt-country","indie","indie rock","folk"],"country":"US","begin":"1989","end":"2009","kind":"Group","similar":["Purple Mountains","Pavement","Smog","MJ Lenderman","Palace Music","Songs: Ohia","Stephen Malkmus","Built to Spill","Magnolia Electric Co.","Bill Callahan"],"img":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/RoTamSilverJewsWIKI.jpg?width=500","bio":"Lo que para muchos empezó siendo sólo el grupo satélite de Pavement, ha acabado en una de las carreras más interesantes de la baja fidelidad estadounidense. Silver Jews, que en realidad son David Berman más los amigos invitados para la ocasión, han conseguido dejar un puñado de discos y canciones de indie-rock en las que el country se les colaba indiscriminadamente. \n\nDesde unos primeros pasos grabados con lo mínimo y cercanos a lo que se cocía en los EEUU de los 90 (Pavement y Sonic Youth a la cabeza de lo que no venía de Seattle)"},"works":[{"id":54006819131534,"type":"album","name":"Starlite Walker","artist":"Silver Jews","year":1994,"weight":15,"yt":"W13_sh0bwXA","src":"books,charts,musthear","from":{"books":[{"name":"Scaruffi","title":"A History of Rock Music 1951-2000 (Piero Scaruffi)"}],"podcasts":[],"lists":[{"id":13018320481353,"name":"Scaruffi 1990s","rank":1157,"scaruffi":7.0},{"id":250477618424467,"name":"RYM Top — Rock — Slacker Rock","rank":136,"scaruffi":7.0}],"n_lists":2}},{"id":183031106563309,"type":"album","name":"The Natural Bridge","artist":"Silver Jews","year":1996,"weight":20,"yt":"16LkluMfFfE","src":"charts,musthear","from":{"books":[],"podcasts":[],"lists":[{"id":187561999930396,"name":"Sputnikmusic Best Albums 1996","rank":60,"scaruffi":null},{"id":118267099057662,"name":"AOTY Must Hear 1990s","rank":160,"scaruffi":null},{"id":84403038516466,"name":"RYM Top — Rock — Alternative Rock","rank":97,"scaruffi":null},{"id":89365250498738,"name":"RYM Top — Rock — I